* HIPs
** HIP-1 native token
*** name <= 6 chars, no uniqueness
*** szDecimals + 5 <= weiDecimals
*** lot = 10^(weiDec - szDec)
*** Dutch auction 31 h\nfloor 500 HYPE, start 2x last
*** 5-step deploy, only step 1 is gas
*** Fee share ratchets down only
*** Daily dust sweep at 00:00 UTC
** HIP-2 Hyperliquidity
*** No operator, no keeper
*** p_i = round(1.003 x p_i-1)
*** Refresh every 3 s in block logic
*** ALO orders in the shared book
*** nSeededLevels funds bids
left side
** HIP-3 builder perps
*** 500k HYPE, min 183 days
*** First 3 assets skip the auction
*** feeScale 0-300%\n(>100% raises protocol fee)
*** Growth mode: >=90% cheaper
*** Cross margin enable is final
*** Backstop at 0x400..00 + dex
*** Slashing 100 / 50 / 20%, burned
** HIP-4 outcome markets
*** Fully collateralised, no leverage
*** Yes + No = 1 quote token
*** Merged book,\nprice-side-time priority
*** split / merge / negate
*** Fees only on close or settle
*** Templates + venue, testnet
** Common pattern
*** Permissionless entry
*** Priced by auction or stake
*** Policed by validator vote
*** Slashed stake is burned
@endmindmap
